    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiya sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yosiya abeeda gaba gweanyeew sis damanda ang'eada gheambalmeedean, ak hean goombaliischi gweanyeew diktam ea damanagi aba Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin ng'asheega doabiiw aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwaat naweeda ghweanda was Dawdi, ak ea mayamsiina geaw meatkweeda geatinda dugwa ghana dea ghaadaam.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiya gwanyarjeawi sanaamajeega sibada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba sis bea gheambalmeadaanyi, nea ea gudea baleanda, hean ghoang'eat gagaseada ASEETA Dawdi was ghwaan, ak aba gweaydeaba damaniyeenya hean ghoang'eat ghwalalakta heetiyeada aba Yuda ea Yerusalemu, ea Asherimu, ea sanaamajeega sisna gearinda ea beasta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanyarjeaweada heeda wagiida bea Baali aba madeadaanyi, ak gwalalaksa ng'eanyi heeda wagiida siyiina geediga ng'andidi mida diyeadayda nyaawa, ak ghwalajaada ghoah banajanga Asherimu ea sanaamajeega sisna gearinda ea beasta, ak ghwanung' ghoah birjeanda ak goohisa badahuuka bung'eadinga fuga siitaw lukghumajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaghwarda geaka ashoohoodiga aba iheenga heeda nyaawa bea wagiida ak ghoamiidu Yuda ea Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aba jeeda mujiinajeega Manase, ea Efraimu, ea Simeoni, ea ghwahita Naftali, jeeda eemeega nyaawa neaweesa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gwalalaksa ng'eanyi heeda wagiida, ak gwanyarjeawi Asherimu ea sanaamajeega sisna geadi ea ghoah birjeanda, ak gwalalaksa ng'eanyi heeda wagiida siyiina haleanjeeda ng'andidi aba jeeda ng'eanyoojiga sean bea Israeli. Aba ng'ata gabiikta Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nyasooda gitaabooda diigheanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeeda gweaydeaba damasis bea gheambalmeadaanyi, nea niibuus ng'eanyiida ea gheeda, hean goojeakta Shafani orjeeda Asaliya ea Maaseya was siida haw bea mujiini, ea Yoa orjeeda Yoahasi was ng'oorshoocheanda, was fuga jea gabiikta ghwadeas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEATAANYI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghapka heeda Hilkiya was ashoohoocheanda haw, ak ghoadaw lapiyeeda siyeadu gheeda ASEETA, ghayi awaam fuga Lawi, ea furiischoodiga gidaghuudajeega niiwaamu aba heeda Manase ea Efraimu ea aba heeda boosteanga sean bea Israeli ea Yudaheeda sean ea Benjamini ea heeda fuga abiita Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghoadaw gearnoodiga miineadaysa gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak ghoadayda saawa aba sinooda gheeda gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadaw gearnoodiga beehajeega ea gea deesa gealga ghwasha lagheanga sigul ea ng'udanga jea eang'oanya gheeda ea gharinga bea gheeda ghayi nung' sugoodiga Yuda ghwadatas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin buuneeda gadiyeeda aba doobiiwnata. Nea gamiineadaysa saawa Yahati sea Obadiya was fuga Lawi, was orjooga Merari, ea Sakariya, ea Meshulamu bea orjooga Gohati. Nea fuga Lawi was gearnoodiga dabita sarmeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gamiineadaysa fuga sar sareenda nea ghoadoabiiw fuga sean nyooh gwasin gilinyoo ea gadiya gil, nea fuga Lawi mwaatkwa ea ng'oorshoodiga gil, ea fuga hees, ea furiischoodiga gidaghuudajeega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iidu nea gooruudu jarooda lapiyeeda ghayi siyeadu jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, Hilkiyaheeda was ashoohoocheanda ghwanyas gitaabooda diigheanda NG'UTAMIIDA ghayi guh aba geatinga Musa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Hilkiya Shafaneeda was ng'oorshoocheanda, “Naanyaschi gitaabooda diigheanda aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA”; ak ghoadaw Hilkiya Shafani gitaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweasa Shafani sugoocheanda gitaabu, aba ng'ata ghoadaw sugoocheanda iita, “Haleanjeeda sean ghayi siiteaga fugaagu bea gadiyeeda nisin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigulgulda lapiyeeda ghayi nyagaan aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ak niidaw fuga miineadayiisa gadiyeeda ea heeda fuga gadiiyi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Shafaneeda was ng'oorshoocheanda gwayeesha sugoocheanda, “Hilkiya was ashoohoocheanda nigoonan gitaabu.” Ng'ata ghoasoamwa Shafani aba madeeda sugoocheanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy sugoocheanda ng'asheega diigheanda hean ghabwaashaada hang'weakaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukusa diigheanda sugoocheanda Hilkiya, ea Ahikamu orjeeda Shafani, ea Abdoni orjeeda Mika, was ng'oorshoocheanda Shafani, ea Asaya was siida gadiyeeda bea sugoocheanda, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aweayeena ak goopearsi NG'UTAMIIDA ng'asheegeasu ea gea fuga siipuut aba Israeli ea Yuda, aba ng'asheega gitaabooda sinyas; aba gideaba nyarasta NG'UTAMIIDA aahaw dea hidu badaydeanya, aba gideaba ghweanigaasa ghayi mwaang'waanya ng'asheega NG'UTAMIIDA, ak gwasin gawuurji gising'waarda aba jeedeaba gitaaboani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Hilkiya sea fuga ajeakta sugoocheanda, gaweay heeda Hulda was sibaneeda was gatmooda, was gatmooda Shalumu was orjeeda Dokhati, bea Hasra was siida fura sandakwajeanda hang'weaka (nea abeeda goobiita Yerusalemu gheedeaba iyeenya) ak goobalool niny aba ng'asheandida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha saawa, “Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA fuga Israeli: ‘Ayeeshiina siida ajeakneegwa heedeanyu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, ng'ula, gaydajagu gidamuyi badaydeaba ng'eanyiini ea badayda fuga bea ng'eanyiida, mooshteayeeka sean ghayi sing'oorsa jeeda gitaabu ak geasoamwa aba madeeda sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ninung'wanaani heeda, ak gagwardeaysa geediga ng'andidi aseecheeka suuk, ghwanung' danyareas aba ng'asheega geatinga nyaawa, ak abeeda nyarasteanyu gayghwahidu badaydeaba ng'eanyiini ak ea majeemiis. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea sugoocheanda fuga Yuda, ajeaktaneegwa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gajayeeshiina niny, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli: Aba ng'asheega niyiinyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba gurooroadaang'u nibumbuniit ak giyaadi geaw ng'eanyi aba madeeda ASEETA damanda iiyiinyi ng'asheagaaschi rukusa ng'eanyiini ea fugeaba ng'eanyiini, ak ea niyaadi geaw ng'eanyi aba madeedeanyu, nea nibwaashaadi hang'weakaagu nea giiyeawdi aba madeedeanyu, eara aniini ea nealeeyseey iita, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula, gaydanung' una heeda ghweanigaagu, ak gajeayiinyi jeeda bung'eadaang'u nea gibea hoyyoo, nea gheanyangaagu mayghwadaah munyasnacheeka sean jea dajaksa badaydeaba ng'eang'i ea badaydeaba fiisu bea ng'eang'iini.’” Hean ghoadealda ng'asheanji heeda sugoocheanda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yosiya gwasin neajeeda jea gwasissa mureeda NG'UTAMIIDA",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta sugoocheanda giijasoodiga ak ghoawaam gweargwa sean bea Yuda ea Yerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwadiyeesa sugoocheanda heeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, sea fuga sean bea Yuda sea fuga abiita Yerusalemu ea ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, buuneeda sean gea hees ea gea manang'i; ng'ata ghoasoamwa aba madeeda nyaawa ng'asheega gitaabooda neajeeda ghayi sinyasa jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghamiinaada sugoocheanda aba heeda abiita ak gwasin neajeeda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gideaba gayghwaat geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA nea ghoang'waayi diigheanyeekaaschi ea gichea ghabeada ea deaweedajeagaaschi, ea aba gurooroadaanyi sean ea aba saseadaanyi sean, nea ghoang'waay ng'asheega neajeeda ghayi sing'oorsa jeedeaba gitaaboani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanung' fuga mida Yerusalemu ea Benjamini ghoang'waay neajeeda. Ak fuga abiita Yerusalemu gaweeda gida gasiida neajeeda ASEETA, ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 34:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanda Yosiya munyasnacheeka mida jeeda ng'eanyoojiga bea fuga Israeli, ak ghwanung' gagadiiyeesa fuga mida Israeli NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA nyaawa. Aba damanda eawoojigaaschi mii ghang'amwa eadita geeshta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.34.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.34.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
